# Generated OBJECT models — per-machine build products (bake absolute paths for training + sim2sim).
# Regenerate on each machine: assets generate
# Source-of-truth that STAYS tracked: <name>.obj, metadata.json, textures, and the CoACD parts under
# convex_decomp_meshes/*.obj (geometry, coacd-free reuse). Robot models under src/assets/<robot>/ stay tracked.
src/assets/omomo_objects/*/*.urdf
src/assets/omomo_objects/*/*_cvx_*.xml
src/assets/sugar_objects/*/*.urdf
src/assets/sugar_objects/*/*_cvx_*.xml
src/assets/custom_objects/*/*.urdf
src/assets/custom_objects/*/*_cvx_*.xml
